' =============================
' Wiring information, comments.
' =============================

'  RMYoung 05305-AQ Wind Speed & Direction Sensor (1)
'    1H:  HWDir Signal Yellow
'    Ground:  WSpd reference Green
'    Ground:  Cable Shield White
'    Ground:  WDir reference Black
'    VX1:  HWDir Excite Blue
'    P1:  HWspd Signal Red
'
'  RMYoung 05305-AQ Wind Speed & Direction Sensor (2)
'    1L:  HWDir Signal Yellow
'    Ground:  WSpd reference Green
'    Ground:  Cable Shield White
'    Ground:  WDir reference Black
'    VX1:  HWDir Excite Blue
'    P2:  HWspd Signal Red
'
'  RMYoung 05305-AQ Wind Speed & Direction Sensor (3)
'    2H:  HWDir Signal Yellow
'    Ground:  WSpd reference Green
'    Ground:  Cable Shield White
'    Ground:  WDir reference Black
'    VX1:  HWDir Excite Blue
'    P3:  HWspd Signal Red
'
'  RMYoung 27106T Wind Speed Sensor (1)
'    3H:  VWspd Signal Red
'    Ground:  WSpd reference Black
'    Ground:  Cable Shield Clear?
'
'  RMYoung 27106T Wind Speed Sensor (2)
'    3L:  VWspd Signal Red
'    Ground:  WSpd reference Black
'    Ground:  Cable Shield Clear?
'
'  RMYoung 27106T Wind Speed Sensor (3)
'    4H:  VWspd Signal Red
'    Ground:  WSpd reference Black
'    Ground:  Cable Shield Clear?
'
'  MetOne 060A2 Air Temp Sensor(1)
'    5H:  Air Temp Signal White
'    Ground:  Air Temp reference Black
'    Ground:  Cable shield
'    VX2:  Excite *Wire a 23.1Kohm resistor between VX2 & 5H
'
'  MetOne 060A2 Air Temp Sensor (2)
'    5L:  Air Temp Signal White
'    Ground:  Air Temp reference Black
'    Ground:  Cable shield
'    VX2:  Excite *Wire a 23.1Kohm resistor between VX2 & 5L
'
'  MetOne 060A2 Air Temp Sensor (3)
'    6H:  Air Temp Signal White
'    Ground:  Air Temp reference Black
'    Ground:  Cable shield
'    VX2:  Excite *Wire a 23.1Kohm resistor between VX2 & 6H
'
'  MetOne 060A2 Air Temp Sensor (4)
'    6L:  Air Temp Signal White
'    Ground:  Air Temp reference Black
'    Ground:  Cable shield
'    VX2:  Excite *Wire a 23.1Kohm resistor between VX2 & 6L
'
'  Rotronics MP101A Air Temp & RH Sensor (constant power)
'    7L:  Air Temperature Siganl Red(Brown)
'    8H:  RH Signal White
'    Ground:  Signal Ground Yellow
'    Ground:  Power Ground Green
'    Ground:  Cable Shield Clear?
'    12V:  Power Blue
'
'  CS100 Barometric Pressure Sensor (constant power)
'    8L:  Baro Signal Out Blue
'    Ground:  Signal Ground Yellow
'    Ground:  Cable Shield Clear
'    5V:  Sensor Enable Green
'    G:  Power Ground Black
'    12V:  Power Red
'
' Eppley PSP1 Precision Spectral Pyranometer (1)*Note: Facing UP (SWDN)
'    9H:  Signal+ Green
'    9L:  Signal- Blue
' *Note: Jumper wire 9L -to- ground
'    Ground:  Cable shield Clear?
' Eppley PSP2 Precision Spectral Pyranometer (2) *Note: Facing DOWN (SWUP)
'    10H:  Signal+ Green
'    10L:  Signal- Blue
' *Note: Jumper wire 10L -to- ground
'    Ground:  Cable shield Clear?
'
' Eppley LWDN Precision Infrared Radiometer (1) *Note: Facing UP (LWDN)
' Solar sensor output
'    11H:  Solar sensor Signal+ Yellow
'    11L:  Solar sensor Signal- Blue
'    11L:  Jumper wire 11L -to- ground
'    Ground:  Cable shield Clear?
' Case temperatre thermistor
'    VX3: Excite *Wire a 1K resistor between VX3 & SE25
'    SE25: Thermistor signal+, White
'    Ground: Thermistor signal-, Black
' Dome temperature thermistor
'    VX4: Excite *Wire a 1K resistor between VX4 & SE26
'    SE26: Thermistor signal+, Red
'    Ground: Thermistor signal-, Green
'
' Eppley LWUP Precision Infrared Radiometer (2) *Note: Facing DOWN (LWUP)
' Solar sensor output
'    12H:  Solar sensor Signal+ Yellow
'    12L:  Solar sensor Signal- Blue
'    12L:  Jumper to Ground
'    Ground:  Jumper wire 12L -to- ground
'    Ground:  Cable shield Clear?
' Case temperatre thermistor
'    VX3: Excite *Wire a 1K resistor between VX3 & SE27
'    SE27: Thermistor signal+, White
'    Ground: Thermistor signal-, Black
' Dome temperature thermistor
'    VX4: Excite *Wire a 1K resistor between VX4 & SE28
'    SE28: Thermistor signal+, Red
'    Ground: Thermistor signal-, Green
'
'  All Weather Rain Gauge wired to a control port
'    Ground:  Cable Shield Clear?
'    P4:  Signal+ Red
'     G:  Signal- Black

' ==================================
' List of equipment and instruments.
